doc:sch-1-sec-270-3-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "270(2) 5  Servitude offences" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person conducts any business; and  (b) the business involves the servitude of another person (or persons). Penalty:  (a) in the case of an aggravated offence (see section 270.8)— imprisonment for 20 years; or  (b) in any other case—imprisonment for 15 years. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006  Criminal Code amendments  Schedule 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Slavery, Slavery-like Conditions and People Trafficking) Act" ;
