    cml:logicSummary "Classifies the offence as aggravated based on machine learning algorithms." ;
    cml:premiseText "The victim is under 18 and subjected to cruel treatment." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The offence is aggravated." ;
    cml:executionSurface "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-1-sec-270-10-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "270(1) 8  Slavery-like offences—aggravated offences" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Division, a slavery-like offence committed by a person (the offender) against another person (the victim) is an aggravated offence if any of the following applies:  (a) the victim is under 18;  (b) the offender, in committing the offence, subjects the victim to cruel, inhuman or degrading treatment;  (c) the offender, in committing the offence:  (i) engages in conduct that gives rise to a danger of death or serious harm to the victim or another person; and  (ii) is reckless as to that danger." ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-270-10-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "270(2) 8  Slavery-like offences—aggravated offences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-270-10-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If the prosecution intends to prove an aggravated offence, the charge must allege the relevant aggravated offence." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If the prosecution intends to prove an aggravated offence, the charge must allege the relevant aggravated offence."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "36219b3b611e2c3aa14e7b814b7bc7fefabd7a5d7d1fec4fe4cadd797202c605" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-270-10 ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prosecution must allege relevant aggravated offence if charged with aggravated offence." ;
    dc:description "Alleging the relevant aggravated offence" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
