    skos:definition "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), this Division is not intended to exclude or limit the concurrent operation of any other law of the Commonwealth, or a law of a State or Territory, that makes:  (a) an act or omission that is an offence against a provision of this Division; or  (b) a similar act or omission; an offence against the law of the Commonwealth, State or Territory."@en ;
