doc:sch-1-sec-271-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "271 7A  Removal of organs contrary to this Subdivision" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The removal of a person’s organ is contrary to this Subdivision if:  (a) the removal, or entering into an agreement for the removal, would be contrary to the law of the State or Territory where it is, or is to be, carried out; or  (b) neither the victim, nor the victim’s guardian, consents to the removal, and it would not meet a medical or therapeutic need of the victim." ;
