    values:originalText "(1) A person (the offender) commits an offence of harbouring a victim if:  (a) the offender harbours, receives or conceals another person (the victim); and  (b) the harbouring, receipt or concealing of the victim: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006  Schedule 1  Criminal Code amendments" ;
