    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (2) only applies if the defendant has been afforded procedural fairness in relation to the finding of guilt for the offence against section 271.8. Note: Section 271.8 provides for the offence of debt bondage." ;
    cof:pageNumber "25"^^xsd:integer .

