concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "271 11A  Offences against Division 271—relevant evidence"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-271-15 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of proceedings for an offence against this Division, the trier of fact may have regard to any of the matters covered by subsection (2) in determining whether, in relation to a person (the alleged victim) against whom the offence is alleged to have been committed:  (a) in the case of an offence against Subdivision B or BB—the alleged victim has been coerced, threatened or deceived; or  (b) in the case of an offence against Subdivision BA—the alleged victim, or the alleged victim’s guardian, has consented to the removal of an organ of the alleged victim; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006  Criminal Code amendments  Schedule 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Slavery, Slavery-like Conditions and People Trafficking) Act" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of proceedings for an offence against this Division, the trier of fact may have regard to any of the matters covered by subsection (2) in determining whether, in relation to a person (the alleged victim) against whom the offence is alleged to have been committed:  (a) in the case of an offence against Subdivision B or BB—the alleged victim has been coerced, threatened or deceived; or  (b) in the case of an offence against Subdivision BA—the alleged victim, or the alleged victim’s guardian, has consented to the removal of an organ of the alleged victim; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006  Criminal Code amendments  Schedule 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Slavery, Slavery-like Conditions and People Trafficking) Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "66e997f3a7fa14ebf92d6d8099f1cfa1d48cfb135b944f335aaf522b2aaee5b4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Relevant evidence for proceedings against an offence against Division 271—coercion, threat, or deception" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2013a00006.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2013a00006.pdf, p.26" ;
    cml:asserts concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-15-norm .
concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-15-norm a values:Obligation ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    values:partOf concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-15 ;
    values:borneBy values:State ;
    skos:scopeNote "borne by: State" ;
    values:deonticStatus values:HeuristicDerived ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
